#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:5
msgid "Cross references settings"
msgstr "交叉引用设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option to storage at the Data from the application"
" some `project properties`_ pre-defined by the user. This feature allows the"
" user avoiding to define many `project properties`_ each time that the user "
"`creates new projects`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 从应用程序中提供了从数据中存储一些 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ "
"由用户预先定义的选项。该特性允许用户每次在用户 `创建新项目 <project properties_>`_ 时避免定义许多 `项目属性 "
"<creates new projects_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:11
msgid ""
"The **Cross references** tab from **New project** settings section allows "
"pre-defining some `cross references properties`_:"
msgstr ""
"**交叉引用** 选项卡来自 **新项目** 设置部分允许预先定义一些 `交叉引用属性 <cross references properties_>`_"
" :"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:14
msgid "Cross references type (Coil, organ of protection or Switch/button)."
msgstr "交叉引用类型(油，保护机关或开关/按钮)."

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:15
msgid "Cross references label"
msgstr "交叉引用标签"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:16
msgid ""
"Representation position cross references label (Under the label of the "
"element or Footer)."
msgstr "表示位置交叉引用标签(在元素或脚的标签下)."

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech New project cross references settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 新项目交叉引用设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:23
msgid "To define cross references settings:"
msgstr "要定义交叉引用设置："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:25
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:26
msgid "Go to **New project** section."
msgstr "转到 **新项目** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:27
msgid "Go to **Cross references** tab."
msgstr "转到 **引用** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:28
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "定义每个字段的理想参数。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:29
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close settings "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改和关闭设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/cross_references_settings.rst:33
msgid ""
"All pre-defined cross references properties defined at QElectroTech settings"
" PopUP window will be automatically defined during `project creation`_ at "
"`project properties`_. The cross references properties can be found at "
"`Cross references tab`_ tab from `New folio`_ section."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 设置中定义的所有预定义的交叉引用属性 PopUP 窗口将在 `项目创建 <project creation_>`_ "
"项目属性 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 中自动定义。交叉引用属性可以在 `Cross 引用标签 <Cross "
"references tab_>`_ 标签中找到，来自 `节的新 folio <New folio_>`_ 。"
